  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Global Covenant of Mayors (GCoM) for Climate and Energy in Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action will strengthen the Regional Covenants of the Global Covenant of Mayors for Climate and Energy in Japan, China, Korea; South East Asia and South Asia. It will support Asian cities to address their climate and energy challenges, in coordination with the Regional Secretariats in each target country and region.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
